@startuml
title Detection flows - retained evidence sample
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
hide footbox

actor Client
boundary "Detection flows controller" as API
control GetDetectionFlowsHandler as Handler
database TimescaleDB as DB

Client -> API : GET /api/v1/detections/{id}/flows\npage, page_size, sort_order
API -> API : Validate UUID and query parameters
API -> Handler : handle(GetDetectionFlowsQuery)
Handler -> DB : One SELECT: parent + matched flows + page + total\nflow.trace_id = ANY(detection.trace_ids)
alt Detection exists
    DB --> Handler : Page rows and total\nparent retained even for an empty page
    Handler --> API : GetDetectionFlowsResponse
    API --> Client : 200 {items, total, page, page_size}
else Detection does not exist
    DB --> Handler : No rows
    Handler --> API : DetectionNotFoundError
    API --> Client : 404 {detail: "Detection not found"}
end
note over Client,DB : Stored trace IDs are a sample of contributing flows.\nOnly matching flows still present in storage are returned.
note over Client,API : Invalid UUID or query: 422 before handler dispatch\nUnavailable database: 503 via shared exception handler
@enduml
